# Workspace path layouts

On this branch Phoenix and EnergoTS live at the repository root. Older rules and commands still say `Cursor-Project/Phoenix/` and `Cursor-Project/EnergoTS/`. Those two layouts are the same trees:

- `Phoenix/` and `Cursor-Project/Phoenix/`
- `EnergoTS/` and `Cursor-Project/EnergoTS/`

Rule 0.8 applies to both spellings. Phoenix stays read-only. EnergoTS writes stay limited to the test agent under `tests/`.
